## In your browser

The command above asks Keelson's API to run the checks. To trust no Keelson server at all, download [the same Alibi](/samples/01M6ZWZJHWRRHQEYNJAT7NMSV8.alibi) and drop it on [verify.keelson.finance](https://verify.keelson.finance). The page runs every check in your browser against trust roots pinned in its code; it reads the chain from a public Arbitrum RPC that you can replace with your own.

## What each check means

Each row is one check the verifier runs, the party whose signature or record it rests on, and how it came out for this Alibi.

| Check | What it checks | Who answers for it | This Alibi |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `bundle.format` | Bundle format | Keelson | Passed |
| `leaf.view` | Log leaf matches the bundle | Keelson | Passed |
| `qr.leaf` | Matches the QR link | Keelson | Not used by this purchase |
| `evidence.manifest` | Evidence manifest | Agent operator | Passed |
| `evidence.web_fact` | Store's product endpoint, notarized (TLSNotary) | Keelson | Not used by this purchase |
| `evidence.checkout` | Checkout total and its breakdown | Agent operator | Not used by this purchase |
| `evidence.conversion` | Currency conversion within the mandate's spread | Agent operator | Not used by this purchase |
| `paypal.ids` | PayPal ids | Keelson | Passed |
| `paypal.amount_authority` | Who decided the amount paid on PayPal | User | Not used by this purchase |
| `card.authorizations` | Card charges approved by both TEEs | Keelson | Not used by this purchase |
| `mandate.challenge` | Mandate challenge | User | Passed |
| `mandate.passkey` | User's passkey signature | User | Passed |
| `mandate.credentials` | Mandate credentials | Keelson | Passed |
| `tee.attestation.tdx` | Intel TDX attestation | Keelson | Passed |
| `tee.attestation.nitro` | AWS Nitro attestation | Keelson | Passed |
| `tee.registry` | Signers registered on-chain | Keelson | Passed |
| `tee.countersign` | TEE countersignature | Keelson | Passed |
| `policy.replay` | Policy decision replayed with Cedar | Keelson | Passed |
| `log.policy` | Log policy is the pinned one | Keelson | Passed |
| `log.inclusion` | Included in the log | Keelson | Passed |
| `log.witnesses` | Witness cosignatures | Witnesses | Passed |
| `anchor.consistency` | Anchor consistent with the log | Keelson | Passed |
| `scitt.statement` | Signed statement (IETF SCITT) | Keelson | Not used by this purchase |
| `scitt.receipt` | Log receipt (COSE) | Keelson | Not used by this purchase |
| `rats.cmw` | TEE evidence package | Keelson | Not used by this purchase |
| `card.statements` | Card decisions and settlement, each logged | Keelson | Not used by this purchase |
| `anchor.root` | Root anchored on-chain | Arbitrum | Passed |
| `anchor.tx` | Anchor transaction | Arbitrum | Passed |
| `timestamps` | RFC 3161 timestamps | Timestamp authorities | Passed |
| `zk.c1` | Zero-knowledge proof | Keelson | Not used by this purchase |
| `zk.c3` | Signed by a registered user, anonymously | Arbitrum | Not used by this purchase |

{% callout type="caution" title="Sandbox and testnet" %}
The purchase was paid on the PayPal sandbox and its bond lives on Arbitrum Sepolia. The TEEs, the public log and its witnesses run in production.
{% /callout %}
